<!-- ============ HEADER ============ -->
<!-- Extracted from src/layout/Header (Component.tsx / Component.client.tsx / Nav/index.tsx)
            Dark theme, solid background (no hero section here to justify the
            transparent-over-hero look the source app uses). Sticky/hide-on-scroll
            (js/header-scroll.js) and the mega menu (js/megamenu.js) are wired up;
            the search modal and alert bar are not implemented. -->
